Error [jet.ComptimeConstructNotSupported]: `greeting` calls `embed_file`, and the running program reaches `greeting` from `run`
  --> tests/ui/comptime_input_reached_at_run_time.jet:3:28
    |
  3 | greeting: fn() -> String { embed_file("greeting.txt") }
    |                            ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The call path run → greeting runs in the program, and the compiler answers `embed_file` only while it compiles
 Fix: Call `greeting` only from compile-time code, such as a prepared constant (`NAME: #run greeting()`), and read that value at run time
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0956
